# Calendar Schedule agent

## Scope

- `/calendars/{id}/` schedule editor (week grid + day editor + settings panel)
- `calendar-schedule.css`, `calendar-*.js`, schedule API/services

## Mobile UX (product direction)

- ≤768px / TG: day chips + **visible week grid** (horizontal scroll with fade/scrollbar hint) + day editor below.
- Tap black week slots → open day editor edit mode (same as desktop).
- Desktop ≥769px: keep week grid + side day editor.
- Settings: accordion/collapse on phone; do not bury primary slot actions.

## Out of scope

- Calendars hub list (`calendars.html`) — Hubs agent
- Public client booking grid — Public Booking

## DoD

- No useless “open editor on the right” copy on mobile.
- Slot add/edit/delete usable with thumb; presets reachable.
- `?v=` bumped; TG scroll shell intact.
